  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds beef tenderloin, at room temperature",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon cracked black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QqSVJCCNi8TxvSwtzzB-Rlpk950=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280268-air-fryer-beef-tenderloin-step-1-dd30b35ff73c4fddb04e2ab8d485a1d8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280268/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat dry tenderloin with paper towels and place on a plate. Drizzle oil all over meat, then sprinkle with oregano, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fi2sqyrdwsHale7RqYklEbLQGqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280268-air-fryer-beef-tenderloin-step-3-0e94630055434450a06283b9197e4b39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280268/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub spices and oil into meat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KdUwQedlryQvaGQ7l_RJjzXxTJk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280268-air-fryer-beef-tenderloin-step-4-BG-e6137aecf3724d79a20b8f2138df0b01.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280268/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place into the preheated air fryer basket, folding as needed to make it fit. Close the lid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xultw_V2rwI57PjMm7Et-FmPACU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280268-air-fryer-beef-tenderloin-step-5-BG-ac6b6d2fd9354b0ca09c687d296b03c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280268/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to 390 degrees F (198 degrees C) and cook for 22 minutes. Reduce heat to 360 degrees F (182 degrees C) and cook for 10 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center of tenderloin should read 135 degrees F (57 degrees C) for medium doneness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XFxj2c6gHJ1txUJwnBL4_Ca97ng=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-280268-air-fryer-beef-tenderloin-step-6-BG-ed36e0f0b7154e3b999a6dac5c78ecd1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/280268/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove tenderloin to a platter. Allow to rest, uncovered, for at least 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
